  m_text: "You think it\u2019s obvious she resents you because she feels that you\u2019re
    responsible for what\u2019s happened to her body. But she denies this and tells
    you she still loves you and that she knows its not your fault, that she just
    needs some time. Tells you that yes, you two should absolutely go to that resort,
    that it\u2019ll be really good to go on your first trip alone since the baby,
    that her p.rekindling the flame on the beaches in Mexic.\n"
